<title>JORDAN: NO TRADES ON JORDAN OVERNIGHT INTERBANK MARKET.</title>
<headline>NO TRADES ON JORDAN OVERNIGHT INTERBANK MARKET.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan's Central Bank said there were no reported trades on the overnight dinar interbank market on Sunday.</p>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate stood at 6.46 percent on Saturday.</p>
<p>($1 = 0.709 dinars)</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
